title: Agricultural Policy
new-page: true
is-card: true
on-arrival: agricultural_policy_timer += 6; month_actions += 1
view-if: kcp_in_government = 1 and (infrastructure_minister_party = "KCP") and (finance_minister_party = "KCP") and agricultural_policy_timer == 0
card-image: img/kcp_agriculture_affairs.png
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet
#subtitle: Issues of agriculture and our farmers population.

= Agricultural Policy

Agricultural policy falls under the control of the Infrastructure ministry and Finance ministry. Historicaly Kaddu has had a citizen market which buys grain for discount prices and "public" fields which are owned by local farmer cooperatives.

- @land_reform
- @agricultural_finance
- @pro_consumer
- @state_buyer
- @root: Do not enact any policies for now.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@land_reform
title: Buy off land from landowners to expand "public" fields for local farmers.
subtitle: -1 budget - Buy off land from landowners to expand "public" fields for local farmers.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if budget <= 0 : Requires 1 budget. ?] [? if judicial_reform < 2 : The judiciary would never allow this. ?]
choose-if: judicial_reform >= 2 and budget > 0
on-arrival: budget -= 1; land_reform += 1; rural_kcp += 5*(1-dissent); rural_hp -= 4*(1-dissent); unemployed -= 1 if unemployed >= 5; hp_relation -= 5; vnpf_relation -= 4; socialist_strength += 8; socialist_dissent -= 5; rural_sol += 3; rural_policy += 1; economic_growth += 0.8;
max-visits: 4

We buy out unused land from land owners and expand "public" farms for local farmers cooperatives.


@agricultural_finance
title: Increase payments to farmers.
subtitle: -1 budget - Raise payouts in the citizen market.
choose-if: budget >= 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1; agricultural_finance += 1; rural_kcp += 5*(1-dissent); rural_hp -= 3*(1-dissent); peoples_party_support += 1; constitutionalist_dissent += 5; neoforsvollrist_dissent += 4; rural_sol += 4; rural_policy += 1; economic_growth += 0.4;

We have increased financial support for small farmers, providing access to credit and insurance, saving them from privation. The left and center of our party are opposed to our rural policy, seeing these policies as giveaways to petit-bourgeois farmers.


@pro_consumer
title: Buy from the citizen market.
subtitle: -1 budget - Buy inexpensive food for our workers.
choose-if: budget >= 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1; pro_consumer += 1; workers_kcp += 4*(1-dissent); unemployed_kcp += 4*(1-dissent); workers_sol += 4; economic_growth += 0.2;

We have bought large quantities of inexpensive food at a loss for our trade unions which are the backbone of the economy.

@state_buyer
title: Rural Commision
subtitle: -2 budget - We will make a Rural Commision to stabilize grain prices for our farmers.
choose-if: budget >= 2
on-arrival: budget -= 2; state_buyer = 1; rural_kcp += 5*(1-dissent); rural_hp -= 3*(1-dissent); rural_vnpf -= 3*(1-dissent); workers_kcp += 4*(1-dissent); unemployed_kcp += 5*(1-dissent); hp_relation -= 5; vnpf_relation -= 3; peoples_party_support += 1; rural_policy += 2; economic_growth += 1.2;
max-visits: 1

Our new Rural Commision stabilizes the grain prices paid out to our workers from the citizens market encouraging its use and boosting our popularity among the farmers.
